    "title": "Senators Examine CCP-Backed Lawfare Targeting US Energy | NTD",
    "text": "The Senate Judiciary Subcommittee on Federal Courts, Oversight, Agency Action, and Federal Rights is looking into how the Chinese Communist Party (CCP) may be targeting U.S. energy producers. Senators on June 25 accused the CCP of funding climate advocacy groups that litigate against American energy companies.\nSenators Examine CCP-Backed Lawfare Targeting US Energy\nSenators probe how the Chinese Communist Party funds climate advocacy groups that litigate against American energy companies.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 6/25/2025, 11:40:26 PM EDT",
